{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/RiseAgainAbout1.gif?t=1746394503\" />Rise Again is an action RPG that combines elements of wizardry, roguelike gameplay, and dungeon crawling. Hack and slash your way through enemies in a medieval fantasy universe, transforming from a forgetful wizard into a skilled dungeon crawler as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spellbinding Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you delivered the final blow, you fell victim to the Lich's curse. You can't remember anything before the curse. As you open your eyes, you find yourself in a mysterious realm with a Portal that resurrects the dead. Explore the new realm, uncover the truth behind resurrection,  and overcome the challenges of this realm alongside others cursed like you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/RiseAgainAbout2.gif?t=1746394503\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Art of Combat...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the ever-changing dungeons to break free from the Lich's Curse, defeat the summoned creatures. Discover numerous spells and enhancements throughout your adventure. Experience unique battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/RiseAgainAbout3.gif?t=1746394503\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you ready to Rise Again?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345170?t=1746394503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345170?t=1746394503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/dd59e19d3be348ac62654146fe427c8c